Stage 1: fluence in water phantom
	-> headmodel -> fluence grid at surface/isocenter plane

Stage 2: TERMA
	-> fluence x attenuation x uen/p or u/p

Stage 3: kernel loading
	-> read .bin kernels -> Kernel3D

Stage 4: dose convolution
	-> TERMA x Kernel -> dose grid

Stage 5: validation
	-> profiles, pdd, output factors, kernel sanity plots

